ANNOTATION
Constitutional challenge of provisions controlling board assertable on appeal.
Section 12-23-120 contemplates that facial constitutional challenges to the provisions under which the state electrical board acts may be asserted on appeal, even though such challenges are not cognizable by the board. Clasby v. Klapper, 636 P.2d 682 (Colo. 1981) (decided under former law).
